      { title: "Collaborative Coding Sprint", detail: "Team-based mini-project challenge simulating agile development: task division, parallel coding, and integration within a 30-minute sprint." },
      { title: "Version Control Introduction", detail: "Basic Git concepts — initializing repositories, staging changes, committing, and understanding why version control is the backbone of professional software development." }
