      { title: "LinkedIn Profile Optimization", detail: "Professional headshot guidelines, headline writing formulas, summary techniques, skills endorsement strategies, and building a compelling professional narrative." },
      { title: "Professional Networking Strategies", detail: "Writing effective connection requests, engaging with industry content, reaching out for informational interviews, and building your professional brand through consistent posting." }
